# Collapsible toggle: icon → title

For `CollapsibleSection` (and the same pattern on `dashboard-panel-title` headers), the title content order is fixed:

1. **Icon** (SVG with `className="dashboard-icon"`, or FA icon sized like it)
2. **Title text**

Wrap both in `dashboard-collapse__label` when using the dashboard/portfolio collapse look.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
title={(
  <span className="dashboard-collapse__label">
    <IconWallet />
    Счета
  </span>
)}

// ❌ BAD — text without leading icon
title="Счета"

// ❌ BAD — text before icon
title={(
  <span className="dashboard-collapse__label">
    Счета
    <IconWallet />
  </span>
)}
```

- Chevron stays outside the label (handled by `CollapsibleSection`).
- Badge/count stays in the `badge` prop, not inside the label before the icon.
- Do not put the section title icon in `headerEnd` (that slot is for actions).
